     \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/msg7086\">msg7086</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 09:51:24 +08:00\">20h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>&gt; 真害怕是 gpt6 收费，使用的是 5.6</p><p>5.6 ？没那么高，给你个 4 级别的就差不多了。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081075\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/64d6/6ac2/51170_normal.png?m=1784387864\" alt=\"Tink\" data-uid=\"51170\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tink\">Tink</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 09:57:41 +08:00\">20h 11m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>我刚试了一下 grok4.6，搞笑，试出来是 opus4.6</p><p> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ep1Mjv.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8ep1Mjv.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/eCUpxvq.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eCUpxvq.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081100\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:00:30 +08:00\">20h 8m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Tink\">Tink</a> 我又看了一下网站说明，这个网站只收录了，cluade 和 OpenAI 的模型，其他模型测，算出来的因子，去和收录的对比，毕竟没有收录其他模型，也就是说只能测 cluade 和 OpenAI 的模型。<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/N9E3iZ2.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N9E3iZ2.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081171\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a24d8830176cef46d6df4fde3465be5c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"zwyhzxy\" data-uid=\"209073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zwyhzxy\">zwyhzxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:10:04 +08:00\">19h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>astra high ，测出来是 luna ，日乐天了这</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081200\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:13:27 +08:00\">19h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/zwyhzxy\">zwyhzxy</a> 那你测要么是被降智了，要么就像我同事一样，使用的是中转站，以为用的是 gpt6 ，结果是路由到 5.6 luna 。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081270\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f312/8e77/398731_normal.png?m=1563948246\" alt=\"loopq\" data-uid=\"398731\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loopq\">loopq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:20:12 +08:00\">19h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>gpt 拼车 两次测试 [5.6 sol 和 6 astra] xhigh 都直接落到了 5.6 luna ，悲催了</p><p>我自己的 codex plus 和 claude 都分别识别正确，6 astra - opus5 ，感觉这种 风控更多还是针对 sub2api 用户</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081284\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3937/efed/721467_normal.png?m=1772153828\" alt=\"StudyFung\" data-uid=\"721467\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/StudyFung\">StudyFung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:21:34 +08:00\">19h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>中转站的 gpt6 ，测出来是 5.5 ，避雷</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081298\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0041b301c00acb60634a6e20d982c466?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kapr1k0rn\" data-uid=\"483239\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kapr1k0rn\">kapr1k0rn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:23:21 +08:00\">19h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这种测试的意义是什么？难道因为是个 5.6 就默认回答得不对，是 6 就是对的？AI 版的因人废言？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081315\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/98f6c48771a29112c6bc06062ed828bb?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"BenCoper\" data-uid=\"506738\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BenCoper\">BenCoper</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:25:29 +08:00\">19h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>测指纹这个意义不大，糖果题一直都是最容易发现降智的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081325\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:26:20 +08:00\">19h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/loopq\">loopq</a> 是的大佬，你自己的是官方客户端没问题的😀。这波是那些使用中转站和非官方的难受了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081374\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6cfd2a37f6a87929944a1bfefc6c97f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"lscho\" data-uid=\"294493\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lscho\">lscho</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:31:24 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>取糖果和鹈鹕是目前最快能测出来智商的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081378\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:31:44 +08:00\">19h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/StudyFung\">StudyFung</a> 我身边同事，使用中转站，选择的是 gpt6 ，实际上测出来是 5.6 luna ，从评论区大佬们反馈来看，中转站和反代的，基本都被降智了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081516\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 10:49:32 +08:00\">19h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a> 看了大佬你的回复了，我觉得这个是正常的。我用 gpt6 模型，或者 5.6 sol 模型的时候，做复杂任务，当前对话窗口回去开子 agent 执行任务，主 agent 管理，子 agent 就会根据任务派发到 gpt 其他模型。你在对话窗口是能够看到那些子 agent 执行的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18081724\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 11:14:11 +08:00\">18h 54m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a> 我是用的 gpt6-astra medium,没有要求其开子任务，之前蹬过 gpt5.6 sol ultra ，子 agent 执行我知道右上角会有子任务列表图标，但是用了 gpt6 后我觉得挺快的，完全不需要子 agent,也没在右上角看到过子 agent 的图标，说白了就是后端直接给路由到 luna 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082386\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/780f/3cc6/627042_normal.png?m=1788853059\" alt=\"yiranw09\" data-uid=\"627042\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yiranw09\">yiranw09</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 13:21:03 +08:00\">16h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>测了一下中转站的几个渠道<br>1. 研究院渠道 GPT6<br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/ELo1msU.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ELo1msU.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>2. Pro 号池<br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/emPLQv4.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/emPLQv4.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>3. Plus 号池<br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/jELVLxq.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jELVLxq.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>测试方法应该是蛮准的，并且消耗比醍醐糖果小多了，开一个 chat 就能进行测试</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082508\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9cb0/75f9/89722_normal.png?m=1782843787\" alt=\"pwinner\" data-uid=\"89722\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pwinner\">pwinner</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 13:44:49 +08:00\">16h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>其实最简单的是鹈鹕测试,大部分人日常使用可能注意不到被降智而已...</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082545\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4e15/d5a3/372578_normal.png?m=1773135111\" alt=\"zjttfs\" data-uid=\"372578\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>27</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zjttfs\">zjttfs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 13:50:51 +08:00\">16h 18m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/pwinner\">pwinner</a> <br>降智体感很明显..<br>特别是 astra 降智.降智后明显弱智,做事做不全等</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082572\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7f6a/173e/671706_normal.png?m=1765423393\" alt=\"kianwww\" data-uid=\"671706\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>28</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kianwww\">kianwww</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 13:54:40 +08:00\">16h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有些客户端在触发风控或者高负载时也会静默降级</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082588\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8bfa/7fd9/433150_normal.png?m=1720579726\" alt=\"None123\" data-uid=\"433150\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/None123\">None123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 13:56:13 +08:00\">16h 12m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>astra max ，测出来是 gpt-5.6-luna</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082642\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6041/6c93/589393_normal.png?m=1766126359\" alt=\"tim9527\" data-uid=\"589393\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>30</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tim9527\">tim9527</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 14:04:49 +08:00\">16h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/mVmdHkh.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mVmdHkh.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>  还可以，看来家宽挺准的，我鹈鹕测试也过了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18082686\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6043/54b7/466962_normal.png?m=1749806234\" alt=\"FakerLeung\" data-uid=\"466962\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>31</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/FakerLeung\">FakerLeung</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 14:10:04 +08:00\">15h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>丸辣，中转站 gpt-5.6-sol ，测出来是 gpt-5.6-luna<br> <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/DVI4YXr.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DVI4YXr.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083042\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6041/6c93/589393_normal.png?m=1766126359\" alt=\"tim9527\" data-uid=\"589393\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tim9527\">tim9527</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 14:59:45 +08:00\">15h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/DpdFnuO.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DpdFnuO.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>  用 Astra 又测试了一次 稳</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083066\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ddd927d69f7ccbf8e9b5a77c7b8500f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yinmin\" data-uid=\"108246\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>34</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yinmin\">yinmin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 15:04:19 +08:00\">15h 4m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>openrouter 选 sol ，测出来 100% sol</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083166\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2651d2e06496c1ef4e0e9e10081dc183?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jko123\" data-uid=\"222376\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jko123\">jko123</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 15:18:08 +08:00\">14h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>自用订阅测的<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/gu5yKtd.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gu5yKtd.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>中转站测的<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/WeEoD8O.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WeEoD8O.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p><p>中转站果然不能用啊</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083233\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 15:28:36 +08:00\">14h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的，中转以后肯定不能用了，一方面是对话数据可能会被卖，最新网上一个博主花 5 位数卖 6tb 的中转数据，大量的 ssh 等 key ，另一方面中转可能会注水，最重要官方会限制，可能会对自己的项目有影响。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083375\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/f28bc154f4f5a1d30ed19e6e9827d2ed?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Cruzz\" data-uid=\"409014\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Cruzz\">Cruzz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 15:48:58 +08:00\">14h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/8k4e8av.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8k4e8av.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>我这的肯定没降智，因为让他给我测试下 hive 认证跑了我百分之 40 的额度。根本用不起，我也不开。5.6sol 够够的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083602\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b198446b72d1e5a3b0090f106a75f3c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sampeng\" data-uid=\"19005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>39</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sampeng\">sampeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 16:25:55 +08:00\">13h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a> 应该不是你要求，而是 codex 的背后会有模型任务，compact ，explore ，都可能是 lua 。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083613\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/57b94f7f153f3745286c0b8db7131786?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"layxy\" data-uid=\"428568\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 16:27:27 +08:00\">13h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/sampeng\">sampeng</a> 如果没降智，咋会这么拉啊，感觉现在使用没有刚出那两天好使了，有时候还不如 gpt5.6 sol</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083622\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b198446b72d1e5a3b0090f106a75f3c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sampeng\" data-uid=\"19005\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sampeng\">sampeng</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 16:29:12 +08:00\">13h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/layxy\">layxy</a> 换 pi/opencode 试试。。那个 codex 太臃肿了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083833\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7cfc/37ec/41234_normal.png?m=1759976577\" alt=\"jwk345\" data-uid=\"41234\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>42</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jwk345\">jwk345</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 17:01:22 +08:00\">13h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/KTyJ97Q.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KTyJ97Q.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a><br>可以可以，我用 DeepSeek 官方 flash 带思考模式，给我测出 gpt-6-astra</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083940\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>44</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 17:21:12 +08:00\">12h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/jwk345\">jwk345</a> #43 还能说啥？只能说明，deepseek 蒸馏了 gpt 。这个网站只能测 gpt 和 cluade code ，其他模型，测出来的结果，只能去和这两家模型里面匹配。<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/n119Wvk.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n119Wvk.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083941\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/81865d92cb26408e850ce0289a7a5e30?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Kokomashiro\" data-uid=\"392987\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>45</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Kokomashiro\">Kokomashiro</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 17:21:17 +08:00\">12h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Composer 2.5 测出来是 3 个 9 的 gpt 5.4 ，你别说还真差不多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083952\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/5c78416e89d4db967b8bafece9bf809a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"0xcode\" data-uid=\"555640\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>46</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/0xcode\">0xcode</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 17:22:21 +08:00\">12h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/lTwbFAo.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lTwbFAo.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>deepDeepSeek4.1</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18084017\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f4e2/4255/691385_normal.png?m=1788846930\" alt=\"senyuLight\" data-uid=\"691385\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>47</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/senyuLight\">senyuLight</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 17:34:14 +08:00\">12h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/0xcode\">0xcode</a> 根据前面数据来看，deepseek 应该是蒸馏了，gpt 和 cluade code 。<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/n119Wvk.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n119Wvk.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18084204\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3160/2be7/57703_normal.png?m=1694079140\" alt=\"jsq2627\" data-uid=\"57703\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>48</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jsq2627\">jsq2627</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 18:18:31 +08:00\">11h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>测试了 Azure OpenAI 上的 gpt-6-astra, gpt-5.6-sol, gpt-5.6-luna ，结果非常准确。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18084503\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e11bf135e88d0853db8151b7e5b35bc1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"menghuitangchao\" data-uid=\"607408\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/menghuitangchao\">menghuitangchao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 20:25:41 +08:00\">9h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我试了官方订阅的 5.4 、luna 、terra 、sol 、6 ，都测出来了，这个算法还是有东西的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18084509\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/5587/d5a7/282500_normal.png?m=1789125983\" alt=\"jiayouzl\" data-uid=\"282500\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>51</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jiayouzl\">jiayouzl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 20:29:58 +08:00\">9h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex+open ai 官方 api 接口（非中转站）<br><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/jxc1eYq.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jxc1eYq.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18084748\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8e65/12e5/351910_normal.png?m=1566210666\" alt=\"crystal1992\" data-uid=\"351910\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>53</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/crystal1992\">crystal1992</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 22:54:28 +08:00\">7h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>不止中转，第三方用指纹浏览器批量创建的号也被标记了，我们客户端直登的 90%降智</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"降智 模型 测试53 replies • 2026-09-14 22:54:28 +08:00 1 Cabana 20h 22m ago 你这一点也不准啊，我用 gemini3.8flsh 测的 3 msg7086 20h 17m ago > 真害怕是 gpt6 收费，使用的是 5.65.6 ？没那么高，给你个 4 级别的就差不多了。 5 Tink 20h 11m ago 我刚试了一下 grok4.6，搞笑，试出来是 opus4.6 6 senyuLight OP 20h 8m ago @Tink 我又看了一下网站说明，这个网站只收录了，cluade 和 OpenAI 的模型，其他模型测，算出来的因子，去和收录的对比，毕竟没有收录其他模型，也就是说只能测 cluade 和 OpenAI 的模型。 7 zwyhzxy 19h 58m ago astra high ，测出来是 luna ，日乐天了这 8 senyuLight OP 19h 55m ago @zwyhzxy 那你测要么是被降智了，要么就像我同事一样，使用的是中转站，以为用的是 gpt6 ，结果是路由到 5.6 luna 。 10 loopq 19h 48m ago gpt 拼车 两次测试 [5.6 sol 和 6 astra] xhigh 都直接落到了 5.6 luna ，悲催了我自己的 codex plus 和 claude 都分别识别正确，6 astra - opus5 ，感觉这种 风控更多还是针对 sub2api 用户 11 StudyFung 19h 47m ago 中转站的 gpt6 ，测出来是 5.5 ，避雷 12 kapr1k0rn 19h 45m ago 这种测试的意义是什么？难道因为是个 5.6 就默认回答得不对，是 6 就是对的？AI 版的因人废言？ 13 BenCoper 19h 43m ago 测指纹这个意义不大，糖果题一直都是最容易发现降智的 14 senyuLight OP 19h 42m ago @loopq 是的大佬，你自己的是官方客户端没问题的😀。这波是那些使用中转站和非官方的难受了 17 lscho 19h 37m ago 取糖果和鹈鹕是目前最快能测出来智商的 18 senyuLight OP 19h 37m ago @StudyFung 我身边同事，使用中转站，选择的是 gpt6 ，实际上测出来是 5.6 luna ，从评论区大佬们反馈来看，中转站和反代的，基本都被降智了。 21 senyuLight OP 19h 19m ago @layxy 看了大佬你的回复了，我觉得这个是正常的。我用 gpt6 模型，或者 5.6 sol 模型的时候，做复杂任务，当前对话窗口回去开子 agent 执行任务，主 agent 管理，子 agent 就会根据任务派发到 gpt 其他模型。你在对话窗口是能够看到那些子 agent 执行的。 23 layxy 18h 54m ago @senyuLight 我是用的 gpt6-astra medium,没有要求其开子任务，之前蹬过 gpt5.6 sol ultra ，子 agent 执行我知道右上角会有子任务列表图标，但是用了 gpt6 后我觉得挺快的，完全不需要子 agent,也没在右上角看到过子 agent 的图标，说白了就是后端直接给路由到 luna 了 24 yiranw09 16h 47m ago 测了一下中转站的几个渠道1. 研究院渠道 GPT6 2. Pro 号池 3. Plus 号池 测试方法应该是蛮准的，并且消耗比醍醐糖果小多了，开一个 chat 就能进行测试 26 pwinner 16h 24m ago 其实最简单的是鹈鹕测试,大部分人日常使用可能注意不到被降智而已... 27 zjttfs 16h 18m ago @pwinner 降智体感很明显..特别是 astra 降智.降智后明显弱智,做事做不全等 28 kianwww 16h 14m ago 有些客户端在触发风控或者高负载时也会静默降级 29 None123 16h 12m ago astra max ，测出来是 gpt-5.6-luna 30 tim9527 16h 4m ago 还可以，看来家宽挺准的，我鹈鹕测试也过了 31 FakerLeung 15h 58m ago 丸辣，中转站 gpt-5.6-sol ，测出来是 gpt-5.6-luna 33 tim9527 15h 9m ago 用 Astra 又测试了一次 稳 34 yinmin 15h 4m ago via iPhone openrouter 选 sol ，测出来 100% sol 35 jko123 14h 50m ago 自用订阅测的中转站测的中转站果然不能用啊 36 senyuLight OP 14h 40m ago 是的，中转以后肯定不能用了，一方面是